---
import ResponsiveImage from '../../../components/redesign/ResponsiveImage.astro';
import InteriorHero from '../../../components/redesign/InteriorHero.astro';
import Layout from '../../../layouts/RedesignLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../../components/redesign/Icon.astro';
import ContactBand from '../../../components/redesign/ContactBand.astro';
import {services} from '../../../data/redesign-services';
---
<Layout title="Auto Repair Services" active="services"><InteriorHero image="/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/promo_img01.jpg" alt="Automotive repair work beneath a raised vehicle" label="MAINTENANCE · DIAGNOSTICS · REPAIR"><p class="eyebrow">CARE FOR EVERY MILE</p><h1>Whatever your car needs, <br/><em>start with a conversation.</em></h1><p>From everyday maintenance to bigger repairs, find the service you need—or tell us what doesn’t feel right.</p></InteriorHero><section class="container section services-directory">{services.map(s=><a href={`/redesign/services/${s.slug}/`} class="directory-card"><ResponsiveImage sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 33vw" class="directory-photo" src={s.image} alt={s.imageAlt} width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"/><h2>{s.title}</h2><p>{s.intro}</p><ul>{s.items.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul><span class="text-link">Explore {s.title.toLowerCase()} </span></a>)}</section><div class="container unsure"><ResponsiveImage src="/assets/redesign/service-advice.jpg" alt="A technician checking a vehicle beneath its open hood" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"/><div><h2>Not sure what to ask for?</h2><p>A noise, a warning light, a change in how it drives—describe it in your own words. You don’t need a diagnosis to request a visit.</p><a class="button" href="/redesign/appointments/?service=Something%20else%20%2F%20not%20sure">Tell us what’s happening</a><p class="helper">Helpful details: when it started, when it happens, and any warning lights you see.</p></div></div><ContactBand/></Layout>
